ASP.NET Core Identity Integration

Authentication & Authorization Implementation Guide

Backend API Project  |  Version 1.0
Overview

This document describes the changes made to integrate ASP.NET Core Identity into the Backend API project. The implementation adds user registration (customer and admin roles), login functionality, role-based access control, and automatic database seeding of default roles.

 
